At 1440 px wide, make the header about 64 px tall. Left: compact Field Shift mark/name. Centre: primary route items with 14–15 px labels, 18 px icons, 10–14 px gaps, active route as a restrained green capsule and inactive labels muted. Right: alerts, AI Agronomist/chat, help, settings. Keep farm/field selection in the page body or a slim context bar. At tablet widths, reduce labels or use overflow. At phone widths, use a compact drawer/bottom navigation rather than cramming every label into the header.

