   Rotations & Schedule: the full crop-by-crop timeline with explicit calendar date windows and crop stages; use Year only as an outer grouping for multi-year horizons. Include planting/harvest windows where supported and all six component scores per rotation (suitability, water, soil health, resilience, productivity, diversity) as numbers.
