4. ROTATIONS PAGE (primary focus — full breakdown)
   4.1 Simple Mode content
   The recommended rotation, shown as a plain crop sequence (e.g., "Wheat → Chickpea → Sorghum → Cover Rest") with the current/active step distinguished from the rest.
   One overall result label, expressed in plain language rather than a bare number where possible (e.g., "A strong fit for your farm" rather than only "92%") — the number can still appear alongside it, just never alone.
   A confidence label (High / Moderate / Limited) with one short reason.
   Total rotation length, stated plainly ("This plan runs for 4 seasons before it's worth reassessing").
