Create a file-by-file traceability table with columns: source path, current responsibility, exported/public symbols, call sites, data read/written, decision, replacement path/component, regression test, and status. The final response must state how many source files were inspected and how many were preserved/refactored/merged/replaced/removed, with blockers listed explicitly.
