Weather storm hero: Original cinematic realistic storm-cloud photograph above agricultural land, layered slate-grey clouds and restrained warm light at the horizon, darker low-detail area on left for overlay text, natural and scientifically plausible weather photography, no text, no lightning fantasy, no branding, ultra-wide aspect.

